{"format":1,"manifest":{"name":"hack","publisher":"vyloxi","version":"1.0.0","displayName":"Hack","description":"Syntax coloring, comment toggling and snippets for Hack (.hack .hck .hh).","engines":{"ferrum":"^0.1.0"},"categories":["Languages"],"icon":"icon.png","repository":"https://github.com/voukengdongmofrankysteve/ferrum-market","license":"MIT","contributes":{"languages":[{"id":"hack","name":"Hack","extensions":[".hack",".hck",".hh"],"grammar":"grammars/hack.json","lineComment":"//","blockComment":["/*","*/"]}],"snippets":[{"language":"Hack","path":"snippets/hack.json"}]}},"files":{"icon.png":{"encoding":"base64","content":""},"grammars/hack.json":{"encoding":"utf8","content":"{\n  \"ignoreCase\": false,\n  \"rules\": [\n    {\n      \"begin\": \"\\\\/\\\\*\",\n      \"end\": \"\\\\*\\\\/\",\n      \"token\": \"comment\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"match\": \"\\\\/\\\\/.*$\",\n      \"token\": \"comment\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"match\": \"#.*$\",\n      \"token\": \"comment\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"match\": \"\\\"(?:[^\\\"\\\\\\\\]|\\\\\\\\.)*\\\"\",\n      \"token\": \"string\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"match\": \"'(?:[^'\\\\\\\\]|\\\\\\\\.)*'\",\n      \"token\": \"string\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"match\": \"\\\\$[A-Za-z_]\\\\w*\",\n      \"token\": \"property\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"match\": \"<<[^>]*>>\",\n      \"token\": \"macro\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"match\": \"<\\\\?hh|\\\\?>\",\n      \"token\": \"macro\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"match\": \"\\\\b(?:0[xX][0-9a-fA-F_]+|0[bB][01_]+|0[oO][0-7_]+|\\\\d[\\\\d_]*(?:\\\\.\\\\d[\\\\d_]*)?(?:[eE][+-]?\\\\d+)?)[uUlLfFdDnNiI]{0,3}\\\\b\",\n      \"token\": \"number\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"match\": \"\\\\b(?:implements|instanceof|insteadof|interface|namespace|protected|abstract|continue|function|default|extends|finally|foreach|include|newtype|private|require|elseif|parent|public|return|static|switch|async|await|break|catch|class|clone|const|final|inout|print|throw|trait|while|yield|where|case|echo|else|enum|self|this|type|for|new|try|use|as|do|if)\\\\b\",\n      \"token\": \"keyword\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"match\": \"\\\\b(?:false|true|null)\\\\b\",\n      \"token\": \"constant\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"match\": \"\\\\b(?:Traversable|Awaitable|Container|arraykey|string|keyset|Vector|float|mixed|shape|tuple|bool|void|dict|Pair|int|num|vec|Map|Set)\\\\b\",\n      \"token\": \"type\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"match\": \"\\\\b(?:invariant|var_dump|print_r|echo)\\\\b\",\n      \"token\": \"function\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"match\": \"\\\\b[A-Z][A-Za-z0-9_]*\\\\b\",\n      \"token\": \"type\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"match\": \"\\\\b[A-Za-z_][A-Za-z0-9_]*(?=\\\\s*\\\\()\",\n      \"token\": \"function\"\n    }\n  ]\n}\n"},"snippets/hack.json":{"encoding":"utf8","content":"{\n  \"Hack file\": {\n    \"prefix\": \"hh\",\n    \"body\": [\n      \"<?hh\",\n      \"\",\n      \"namespace ${1:App};\",\n      \"\",\n      \"$0\"\n    ],\n    \"description\": \"A strict file\"\n  },\n  \"Async function\": {\n    \"prefix\": \"afn\",\n    \"body\": [\n      \"async function ${1:name}(${2:string \\\\$arg}): Awaitable<${3:void}> {\",\n      \"  $0\",\n      \"}\"\n    ],\n    \"description\": \"An async function\"\n  },\n  \"Class\": {\n    \"prefix\": \"class\",\n    \"body\": [\n      \"final class ${1:Name} {\",\n      \"  public function __construct(private ${2:string} \\\\$${3:field}) {}\",\n      \"  $0\",\n      \"}\"\n    ],\n    \"description\": \"A class\"\n  }\n}\n"},"README.md":{"encoding":"utf8","content":"# Hack\n\nSyntax coloring, comment toggling and snippets for Hack.\n\n## Files\n\n`.hack`, `.hck`, `.hh`\n\n## Features\n\n- Colors keywords, types, strings, numbers, comments and more. The colors follow your theme.\n- **Toggle Line Comment** (Ctrl+/) uses `//`.\n- 3 snippets.\n\n## Snippets\n\nType the prefix and press Tab.\n\n| Prefix | What it inserts |\n| --- | --- |\n| `hh` | A strict file |\n| `afn` | An async function |\n| `class` | A class |\n\nThis extension runs no code and asks for no permissions. It is built with the [language contribution](https://ferrum.vyloxi.com/docs/languages) format.\n"}}}